  Lines:
  - Speaker: 1
    Text: 'The same names repeat on every sheet: Charles, Max, Danny…'
  - Speaker: 1
    Text: 'At the very bottom, a fresh line: {name} — Status: Active.'
  - Speaker: 0
    Text: 'What is this nonsense…'
